"text":"Lightheaded. Nothing but a high pitched sound deep in my ear. Blurry, overexposed, shapeless blobs of light floating in front of me. Can't feel my fingers, can't move my head, can't remember anything at all. The sharp smell of metallic blood and artificial sweetener enters my nostrils simultaneously.",
